  _data:
    _json: '{"graph":{"variables":{"Kind":"Flow","collection":{"$content":[],"$version":"A"},"$version":"A"},"controlInputDefinitions":[],"controlOutputDefinitions":[],"valueInputDefinitions":[],"valueOutputDefinitions":[],"title":"Encounter - the lender''s men","summary":"The lender sends his men to collect, a handful of times in the life of the debt (Code/Game/Voyage/Collectors.cs; Data/collectors_793.json). Four moments of theirs, each an event here, and what happens at each: his day to send comes; they catch her; she answers them on their card; they give up. Their boat itself (sailing the lanes, asking round a quay, seeing her, rowing for her) is in the code. Their words are in the cards (Data/encounters/wokerer_793.json).","pan":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0},"zoom":1.0,"elements":[{"coroutine":false,"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"aaa00c04-605a-4d78-9030-3d5c08a02c2d","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.OnTheLendersDayToSend","$id":"9"},{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":420.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"12c787b3-19cc-4931-bfc2-ce459790f5de","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.If","$id":"11"},{"defaultValues":{"by":{"$content":1.0,"$type":"System.Double"}},"position":{"x":700.0,"y":-20.0},"guid":"30350514-d9ab-487d-a356-efce050facf7","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.LenderCools","$id":"13"},{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":700.0,"y":130.0},"guid":"803b5620-5a01-4420-ac37-ebb55f28356e","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.LendersMenSetOut","$id":"15"},{"coroutine":false,"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":0.0,"y":420.0},"guid":"f2108d2e-7f7d-4d59-8223-d3e5f1d7a797","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.OnTheLendersMenCatchHer","$id":"17"},{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":420.0,"y":420.0},"guid":"4d3cab5e-e865-4ebb-9ff1-8351faa1b185","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.LendersMenTheirCardComes","$id":"19"},{"coroutine":false,"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":0.0,"y":800.0},"guid":"ffd4a543-a555-479a-ad2b-3d3575bdf997","$version":"A","$